  "name": "Raspberry Lemonade",
  "subtitle": "A fizzy raspberry drink with citrus brightness",
  "description": "Combine raspberry lemonade with lime, water, and lemon-lime carbonation, then serve over crushed ice with fresh raspberry and mint garnishes.",
